---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, array_length(answer_embedding), trunc(_score, 3) as _score  FROM vector_search(qs, 'second', answer) order by _score desc, id desc LIMIT 4;"
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: _score DESC NULLS FIRST, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).id DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |   Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).answer, array_length(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).answer_embedding), trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)._score, Int64(3)) AS _score          |
|               |     SearchTelemetry                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer)                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |         Projection: search_index._score, base_table.answer, search_index.answer_embedding, search_index.id, search_index.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                                                        |
|               |           Sort: search_index._score DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |             Projection: search_index.id, search_index.question, search_index.answer_embedding, search_index._score, base_table.answer, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                                                    |
|               |               Left Join: search_index.id = base_table.id, search_index.question = base_table.question                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                   SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                     Projection: CAST(union_extract(json_get(tbl.key, Utf8("id")), Utf8("int")) AS Int64) AS id, CAST(union_extract(json_get(tbl.key, Utf8("question")), Utf8("str")) AS Utf8) AS question, tbl.data AS answer_embedding, Float64(1) - tbl.distance AS _score |
|               |                       TableScan: tbl                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                 Projection: base_table.answer, base_table.id, base_table.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   TableScan: base_table projection=[answer, id, question, reference_answer, source, subject]                                                                                                                                                                 |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [_score@3 DESC, id@0 DESC], fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@3 DESC, id@0 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[id@3 as id, answer@1 as answer, array_length(answer_embedding@2) as array_length(vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), answer).answer_embedding), trunc(_score@0, 3) as _score]                                                                        |
|               |       SearchTelemetryExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |           ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@3 as _score, answer@4 as answer, answer_embedding@2 as answer_embedding, id@0 as id, question@1 as question, reference_answer@5 as reference_answer, source@6 as source, subject@7 as subject]                                        |
|               |             HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1), (question@1, question@2)], projection=[id@0, question@1, answer_embedding@2, _score@3, answer@4, reference_answer@7, source@8, subject@9]                   |
|               |               CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                 ProjectionExec: expr=[union_extract(json_get(key@1, id), int) as id, union_extract(json_get(key@1, question), str) as question, data@0 as answer_embedding, 1 - distance@2 as _score]                                                                        |
|               |                   RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                     CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                       BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                         S3VectorsQueryExec (INDEX_NAME_1): limit=100                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |               SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                   DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
